        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.12.1+EXO.12.2+EXO.12.3+EXO.12.4+EXO.12.5+EXO.12.6+EXO.12.7+EXO.12.8+EXO.12.9+EXO.12.10+EXO.12.11+EXO.12.12+EXO.12.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Khur. 12.1-13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.16.1+DEU.16.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Likh. 16.1-2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Endaalo eye ekhumi na chine eye kumwesi kwe khunyoa eli endaalo eye e pasaka eya Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.12.14+EXO.12.15+EXO.12.16+EXO.12.17+EXO.12.18+EXO.12.19+EXO.12.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Khur. 12.14-20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.23.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "23.15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.34.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "34.18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.16.3+DEU.16.4+DEU.16.5+DEU.16.6+DEU.16.7+DEU.16.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Likh. 16.3-8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ne khu ndaalo eye ekhumi na chiraano eye kumwesi kuno, eliba eya naikara. Khu ndaalo saba kumukaati kukhalimo limela kwong'ene nikwo kuliibwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khu ndaalo enyoa eya naikara mube ne libuusiana litakatifu. Ne mukhakholakho kumulimo kwosi kwosi tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne kakhali aana siianwa sie khukhwosia khu Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi. Aana chiuunwa chibili chindiiti, limiiku lilala, ne kamameeme ke siseecha saba ke bukhulu bwe kumwiiko mulala, koosi kakhalimo ne butekhele tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lundi aana siianwa sie biakhulia sie bufu butubaanisibwe ne kamafura. Aana bitaru khwi khumi mu siikula bie bufu khu buli euunwa, ne bibili khwikhumi khu buli limiiku, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ne silala khwikhumi khu buli limeeme khu mameeme. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lundi aana endurume ndala nga siianwa sie khurusiao bubwoni khulwe khureera khubeelwa bubwoni bwenywe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mulaana biianwa bino khutasa khu siianwa sie khukhwosia sie kumutikhinyi, sili siianwa sia buli lwosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mungila yino ne eng'ene, mulaana buli endaalo khu ndaalo saba siianwa sie biakhulia, khulwe khukhwosia esilikakha esiimisia Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi. Muaane khutasa khu siianwa sie khukhwosia sia buli lwosi ne siianwa sie khunywa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mubuusiane khulwe khukhwesaaya endaalo eya saba. Ne mu khakholakho kumulimo kwosi kwosi tawe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
