                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Khu ndaalo enyoa eye biakhulia bie khunyoa bie likesa, aanila Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi biakhulia biiyaaya mu siise sia Naikara eye Likesa nga muba ne libuusiana litakatifu. Mukhakholakho kumulimo kwosi kwosi tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ana siianwa sie khukhwosia nga esilikakha esiimisia Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi. Aana chiuunwa chibili chindiiti, limiiku lilala, ne kamameeme ke siseecha saba ke bukhulu bwe kumwiiko mulala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lundi aana siianwa sie biakhulia sia abweene sie bufu butubaasibwe ne kamafura, aana bitaru khwi khumi sie siikula sie bufu khu buli euunwa, ne bibili khwikhumi khu buli limiiku, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ne silala khwikhumi khu buli limeeme. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lundi aana endurume ndala khulwe khurusiao bubwoni, khulwe khurusiao bubwoni bwenywe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aana lundi biianwa bie khunywa khutasa khu bie khukhwosia bia buli lwosi ne biianwa bie biakhulia. Mukhoya mubone muli se bilikhomo butekhele tawe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.31"
            ]
          }
        }
